  "html": "<h1>自动驾驶学习资料合集</h1><blockquote><p>本文原作者：王方浩 | 项目文档主页：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://dig-into-apollo.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html%23\">Dig into Apollo</a></p></blockquote><hr><img src=\"notebooks/assets/note-1786967965890/image-20260817120647-8q9t4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\"><p></p><h2>推荐轻量级开源平台</h2><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://github.com/wheelos/apollo-lite\"><strong>Apollo-Lite</strong></a>：专注于自动驾驶轻量级开源平台，通过删减非核心模块、优化容器及编译流程，打造更适合快速部署和学习研究的平台。</p><ul><li><p>⭐ GitHub（官方仓库）：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://github.com/wheelos/apollo-lite\">https://github.com/wheelos/apollo-lite</a></p></li><li><p>⭐ Gitee（国内镜像）：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://gitee.com/daohu527/apollo-lite\">https://gitee.com/daohu527/apollo-lite</a></p></li><li><p>⭐ 自动驾驶套件：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">自动驾驶一体化套件</a></p></li></ul></li></ul><hr><h2>一、 教学视频</h2><p><strong>1. 综合</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">百度和优达学城合作课程</a>（<em>入门推荐！</em>）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Apollo自动驾驶 - 百度技术学院</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">多伦多大学自动驾驶Coursera公开课</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">MIT自动驾驶公开课</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">MIT自动驾驶访谈</a>（业界大神分享）</p></li></ul><p><strong>2. 地图&amp;定位</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">iMorpheusAI的自频道-优酷视频</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">【高翔】视觉SLAM十四讲</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>3. 深度学习</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">吴恩达深度学习 - B站</a>（<em>入门推荐！</em>）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">李宏毅机器学习 - B站</a>（<em>入门推荐！</em>）</p></li></ul><p><strong>4. 多目标追踪</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">多目标跟踪（MOT）- 查尔姆斯理工</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>5. 多传感器融合</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Matlab传感器融合和跟踪</a></p></li></ul><hr><h2>二、 书籍</h2><p><strong>1. 综合</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《无人驾驶原理与实践》</a>（兰州大学团队，入门推荐）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《无人驾驶：人工智能如何颠覆汽车》</a>（入门推荐）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《第一本无人驾驶技术书》</a>（入门推荐）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《自动驾驶技术概论》</a>（北航与百度联合编写）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《概率机器人》</a>（公式较多，经典推荐！）</p></li></ul><p><strong>2. 地图&amp;定位</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《视觉SLAM十四讲》</a>（<em>入门推荐！</em>）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《机器人学中的状态估计》</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《Computational Geometry》</a>（计算几何，主要用于地图库API）</p></li></ul><p><strong>3. 感知</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《深度学习》</a>（花书，经典教材）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《动手学深度学习》</a>（偏实践，注意框架为Keras）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《机器学习》</a>（西瓜书，<em>入门推荐！</em>）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《Pytorch Documentation》</a>（官方手册，<em>入门推荐！</em>）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《计算机视觉》</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>4. 规划</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《PLANNING ALGORITHMS》</a>（规划算法，英文版）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《Robotics Modelling, Planning and Control》</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《Modern Robotics》</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《Trajectory Planning for Automatic Machines and Robots》</a>（轨迹规划）</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">《强化学习》</a>（强化学习基础理论，规划未来方向）</p></li></ul><p><strong>5. 控制</strong></p><ul><li><p>《Feedback Control of Dynamic Systems》（控制理论经典教材）</p></li><li><p>《PID controllers: Theory, design and tuning》、《Advanced PID Control》（PID经典）</p></li><li><p>《自动控制原理》（胡寿松版，国内经典）</p></li></ul><p><strong>6. 车联网（白皮书类）</strong></p><ul><li><p>车联网白皮书（C-V2X白皮书）</p></li><li><p>车联网白皮书（2018年）</p></li><li><p>车联网网络安全白皮书（2017年）</p></li><li><p>车联网白皮书（2017年）</p></li><li><p>C-V2X业务需求演进</p></li><li><p>车辆高精度定位白皮书</p></li><li><p>C-V2X产业化路径和时间表研究白皮书</p></li><li><p>LTE-V2X安全技术白皮书</p></li><li><p>MEC与C-V2X融合应用场景</p></li><li><p>C-V2X白皮书</p></li></ul><hr><h2>三、 自动驾驶技术栈 &amp; 开源项目</h2><p><strong>1. 自动驾驶技术栈架构</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">自动驾驶技术栈图解及思维导图原图</a>（涵盖硬件和软件两大类划分）</p></li></ul><p><strong>2. 开源全栈</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Apollo</a>：百度自动驾驶项目，集成各模块。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Autoware</a>：名古屋大学发起的最早开源自动驾驶项目之一。</p></li></ul><p><strong>3. 仿真</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Udacity</a>：优达学城自动驾驶仿真平台。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">CARLA</a>：Intel与丰田合作项目。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">AirSim</a>：微软开源仿真平台（支持无人机）。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">LGSVL</a>：LG的自动驾驶仿真平台。</p></li></ul><p><strong>4. 中间件</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">ROS</a>：机器人操作系统/软件库。</p></li><li><p>Cyber RT：Baidu Apollo使用的中间件。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">AUTOSAR</a>：汽车开放系统架构（汽车软件框架标准）。</p></li></ul><hr><h2>四、 数据集</h2><p><strong>1. 驾驶数据集</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">KITTI</a>：知名自动驾驶基准数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Cityscapes</a>：城市街景语义解析。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Mapillary</a>：地理标记街景照片库。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"http://comma.ai\">comma.ai</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">'s Driving Dataset</a>：手机改装低成本方案行车记录仪数据。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Udacity's Driving Dataset</a>：优达学城开源驾驶数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Washington DC's Lidar Data</a>：华盛顿特区激光雷达数据。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">ApolloScape</a>：百度复杂道路场景数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">BDDV</a>：伯克利大规模驾驶视频数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Oxford RobotCar</a>：牛津1000小时以上多天气/季节数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">nuScenes</a>：Aptiv带标注的大型传感器数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Waymo Open Dataset</a>：CVPR2020发布的完整场景数据集。</p></li></ul><p><strong>2. 交通标志数据集</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">KUL Belgium Traffic Sign Dataset</a>：比利时交通标志数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">German Traffic Sign (GTSRB)</a>：德国交通标志识别数据集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">STSD</a>：包含3488个交通标志的标注图像集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">LISA</a>：包含7855条标注的交通标志集。</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/58422485?utm_source=zhihu&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=554011885587062784\">Tsinghua-Tencent 100K</a>：腾讯与清华合作的数据集（10万张图片）。</p></li></ul><hr><h2>五、 论文</h2><p><strong>1. 论文下载入口</strong></p><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://sci-hub.se/\">Sci-Hub 论文下载</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>2. 自动驾驶综述</strong></p><ul><li><p><em>Self-Driving Cars: A Survey</em></p></li><li><p><em>Towards Fully Autonomous Driving: Systems and Algorithms</em></p></li><li><p><em>A Survey of Autonomous Driving: Common Practices and Emerging Technologies</em></p></li><li><p><em>A Survey of Deep Learning Techniques for Autonomous Driving</em></p></li></ul><p><strong>3. 定位论文</strong></p><ul><li><p><em>A survey of the state-of-the-art localization techniques and their potentials for autonomous vehicle applications</em></p></li><li><p><em>Simultaneous localization and mapping: A survey of current trends in autonomous driving</em></p></li><li><p><em>Past, Present, and Future of Simultaneous Localization And Mapping: Towards the Robust-Perception Age (2016)</em></p></li><li><p><em>A critique of current developments in simultaneous localization and mapping (2016)</em></p></li><li><p><em>Map-Based Precision Vehicle Localization i